n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The ventilation workup starts with a blower-door test to establish how tight the house actually is, adds several days of logged carbon dioxide and humidity readings from the rooms you live in, checks combustion safety on any atmospherically vented boiler or water heater, and surveys realistic duct routes.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">You end up with a target fresh-air rate for your specific house and the ERV, filtration, and sealing options that reach it \u2014 ranked by what the data says, not by what happens to be on the truck.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-35f06ea7 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"\/contact\/\">Book the Ventilation Workup<\/a><\/div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-button is-style-outline is-style-outline--3\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"tel:+1\">Call Now<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"s-credits has-small-font-size wp-block-paragraph\">Photos: &quot;1501-1509 R Street NW&quot; by NCinDC, BY-ND, via Openverse \u00b7 AI-generated (gpt-image-1) \u00b7 AI-generated (gemini-2.5-flash-image)<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Sealed your Bethlehem home too tight? ERVs, blower-door targets (3-5 ACH50), and filtration strategies for Moravian-district houses that stopped breathing.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":0,"featured_media":197,"parent":0,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"location","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"_angie_page":false,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-92","page","type-page","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"acf":[],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v28.0 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>You Sealed Your Bet